  "releaseNotes": "Adapted to IDriver async interface and ITransport spec. SQL query results mapped to IPoint data via IoTDatabaseDriver. Built on XCode DAL for multi-database support (MySQL, SQLite, SQL Server, Oracle, PostgreSQL, DaMeng). ControlRequest/ControlResult support.  适配IDriver全异步接口与ITransport规范，通过IoTDatabaseDriver将SQL查询结果映射为IPoint数据，基于XCode DAL支持多数据库。",
